(The idea of an absolute position in space and time was central to Newton's) Tj
72 9786 Td
(theory. In this theory, an event could be assigned coordinates: three) Tj
72 9772 Td
(numbers specifying its position in space, and one number giving the time at) Tj
72 9758 Td
(which it occurred.

But this picture was overturned by Einstein's theory of) Tj
72 9744 Td
(relativity. There is no unique answer to the question of how time is) Tj
72 9730 Td
(passing.

Einstein's theory also unified space and time into a single) Tj
72 9716 Td
(entity: spacetime. The speed of light is the same for all observers.

This) Tj
72 9702 Td
(simple postulate led to extraordinary consequences: time dilation, length) Tj
72 9688 Td
(contraction, and the equivalence of mass and energy \(E=mc2\).) Tj
